          "characters": 76
        },
        {
          "text": "For the pastor carrying it alone: teaching, training, and people who will stand with you.",
          "audience": "Pastors and church leaders",
          "characters": 89
        },
        {
          "text": "You do not need to clean yourself up first. Come as you are and meet Jesus.",
          "audience": "Those who do not yet know Jesus",
          "characters": 75
        },
        {
          "text": "Your influence can outlast you. See where partnership goes and what it builds.",
          "audience": "Ministry partners and donors",
          "characters": 78
        },
        {
          "text": "Know who you are in Christ, and what He has already given you authority to do.",
