      "strings": [
        {
          "text": "THE WORD FOR ALL THE WORLD strengthens the local church to fulfill the Great Commission, until EVERY1 knows the name Jesus.",
          "length": "short",
          "characters": 123
        },
        {
          "text": "THE WORD FOR ALL THE WORLD strengthens the local church to fulfill the Great Commission, until EVERY1 knows the name Jesus. It works through three initiatives: Revival To My City stirs the local church to return to their first love, the EVERY1 Movement empowers it to do the Great Commission, and the School of the Local Church trains believers to know their authority in Christ.",
          "length": "medium",
          "characters": 379
        },
        {
          "text": "THE WORD FOR ALL THE WORLD strengthens the local church to fulfill the Great Commission, until EVERY1 knows the name Jesus. The local church is not a strategy for the plan. It is the plan. Three initiatives carry that work in order. Revival To My City stirs the local church to return to their first love. The EVERY1 Movement empowers the local church to walk in unity to do the Great Commission and walk in God's calling. The School of the Local Church trains believers to know their authority in Christ and build a real relationship with Jesus. Every figure published by this ministry comes from its official record, and every testimony is told by the person it belongs to, with their permission.",
          "length": "long",
          "characters": 698
        },
        {
          "text": "The EVERY1 Movement is a movement of ordinary believers who share Jesus where they already live, work, and study. It is a lifestyle, not an event: you are the minister, sent by God everywhere you go. Every believer qualifies, and the first step is simply to share Jesus with one person this week.",
          "audience": "The Sent Believer",
          "characters": 296
        }
      ]
